---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller != projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_published --> q_revert_state: results not published
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_published --> q_check_supplied: results published
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_dup: tokens already supplied
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_fees: tokens not yet supplied
    q_calc_fees --> q_calc_total: legionFee = totalTokens * legionFeeBps / 10000
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = totalTokensAllocated + legionFee + referrerFee
    q_transfer --> q_set_flag: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_set_flag --> [*]: tokensSupplied = true, emit TokensSupplied

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: fee calculation uses basis points (bps / 10000)
        INV-002: total transferred = allocations + all fees
    end note

    note right of q_set_flag
        INV-003: tokens can only be supplied once
        INV-004: supply requires results to be published first
    end note
